  "citation": "README.md:73@6a251bf73af5",
  "quote": "Closed sessions must not be treated as resumable. Do not turn session names into unique identifiers if runtime accepts duplicates.",
  "path": "docs/programs/reactive-context-assembly-2026-10-18/README.md",
  "heading": "### C6. session recover / handoff (P0)",
  "line": "Input: workspace, optional session identity or receipt. Output: <W1> <W2> graph/definition basis and render receipt, validity, active/closed status, resumption options. Closed sessions must not be treated as resumable. Do not turn session names into unique identifiers if runtime accepts duplicates. For handoff, require explicit render ID rather than reconstructing it from model text."
